// [DRAFT] D281 — the sand dervish Kesh: oath of Balance, Warden of Balance (BACKLOG 22)
say|OATH_DERVISH|The sand knows neither light nor darkness. Only balance.
say|OATH_DERVISH|Swear to the sands and you will become a Warden of Balance: steadfastness, a shield and a calm hand.
say|OATH_DERVISH|The oath is for life. From the fifth level, I will hear you.
exit|
